   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Italy Flood Relief Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Throughout May 2023, deadly flooding and landslides have struck Italy&apos;s northern Emilia-Romagna region. More than 10,000 people have been evacuated and nearly 10 people have been killed after 14 rivers burst their banks in the region following heavy rainfall. All donations to this fund will exclusively support local relief and recovery efforts.</narrative>
  </description>
